{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_1","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"卷十四（2）","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_2","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"雨霁遊龍山次五松韻","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_3","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"日須登獨秀台，碧山重叠畫圖开。","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_4","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"閒心自與澄江老，逸興離還白發來？","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_5","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"入海門舟亂發，風臨松顶鶴双回。","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_6","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"夜凭虛閣窥星漢，殊覺諸峰近斗魁。","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_7","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"光亭子勝雲台，雨後高凭遠目开。","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_8","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"乡里正須吾辈在，湖山不負此公來。","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_9","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"邊秋思丹楓盡，霜外緘書白雁回。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_10","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"幽朔會傳戈甲散，已聞南檄授渠魁。","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_11","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"雪窗閒臥","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_12","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"回双闕曙光浮，懶臥茅斋且自由。","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_13","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"巷僻料應無客到，景多唯擬作詩酬。","sortOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_14","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"巖積素供开卷，叠嶂回溪好放舟，","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_15","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"破虜玉關真細事，未將吾筆遂輕投。","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_16","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"次韻畢方伯寫懷之作","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_17","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"顏心跡皋夔業，落落乾坤無古今。","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_18","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"公自平王懷真氣，誰能晚節負初心？","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_19","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"情老去驚猶在，此樂年來不費尋。","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_20","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"矮屋低頭真局促，且從峰顶一高吟。","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_21","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"春晴散步","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_22","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"晨急雨過林霏，餘點煙稍尚滴衣。","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_23","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"隔水霞明桃亂吐，沿溪風暖藥初肥。","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_24","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"情到底能容懶，世事從前且任非。","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_25","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"對眼春光唯自領，如誰歌詠月中歸。","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_26","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"用舞霓裳，巖花自舉觴。古崖松半朽，陽穀草長芳。","sortOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_27","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"竹穿風磴，雲萝繡石床。孤吟動梁甫，何處臥龍岡？","sortOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_28","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"次魏五松荷亭晚興","sortOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_29","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"座松陰盡日清，當軒野鶴复時鳴。","sortOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_30","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"風光於我能留意，世味酣人未解醒。","sortOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_31","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"擬心神窥物外，休將姓字重乡評。","sortOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_32","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"飛騰豈必皆伊呂，歸去山田亦可耕。","sortOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_33","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"後飛觴亂掷梭，起從風竹舞婆娑。","sortOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_34","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"疏慵已分投箕潁，事業無勞問保阿。","sortOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_35","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"水層城來鶴駕，紫雲双闕笑金娥。","sortOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_36","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"摶風自有天池翼，莫倚逢蒿斥鵪窠。","sortOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_37","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"次張體仁聊句韻","sortOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_38","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"底湖山自一方，晚林雲石坐高涼。","sortOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_39","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"閒心最覺身多系，遊興還堪鬢未蒼。","sortOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_40","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"杪風泉長滴翠，霜前巖菊尚餘芳，","sortOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_41","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"秋江畫舫休輕發，忍負良宵鐙燭光。","sortOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_42","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"沧江鷗鷺翔。海內交遊唯酒伴，年來蹤跡半僧房。","sortOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_43","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"過未盡青雲話，無奈官程促去航。","sortOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_44","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"林人靜一燈歸，回首諸天隔翠微。","sortOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_45","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"千里月明京信遠，百年行樂故人稀。","sortOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_46","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"知造物終難定，唯有煙霞或可依。","sortOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_47","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"總為迂疏多抵捂，此生何忍便脂韦。","sortOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_48","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"題郭詡濂溪圖","sortOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_49","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"生作濂溪像，其類與否吾何從辨之？","sortOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_50","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"使無手中一圖，蓋不知其為誰矣。","sortOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_51","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"筆畫老健超然，自不妨為名筆。","sortOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_52","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"生揮寫最超群，夢想形容恐未真。","sortOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_53","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"月光風千古在，當時黃九解傳神。","sortOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_54","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"西湖醉中謾書","sortOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_55","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"光潋滟暗偏好，此語相傳信不誣。","sortOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_56","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"景中况有佳賓主，世上更無真畫圖。","sortOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_57","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"風欲雨吟堤树，春水新添没渚蒲。","sortOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_58","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"南北双峰引高興，醉携青竹不須扶。","sortOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_59","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"文衡堂试事畢書壁","sortOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_60","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"闈秋鎖動經旬，事了驚看白發新。","sortOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_61","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"造作曾無酣蚁句，支離莫作畫蛇人。","sortOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_62","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"絲擬得長才補，五色兼愁過眼頻。","sortOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_63","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"袖手虛堂聽明發，此中豪杰定誰真。","sortOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_64","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"君以予白發之句，试觀予鬢，","sortOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_65","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"果見一絲。予作詩實未嘗知也。","sortOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_66","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"書一絕識之：忽然相見尚非時，","sortOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_67","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"豈亦殷勤效一絲？總使皓然吾不恨，","sortOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_68","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"心還有爾能知。","sortOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_69","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"遊泰山","sortOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_70","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"湍下雲窟，千尺泻高寒。","sortOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_71","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"昨向山中見，真如畫里看。","sortOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_72","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"風吹短鬢，霜氣肅群峦。","sortOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_73","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"好記相從地，秋深十八盤。","sortOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_74","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"雪巖次蘇穎濱韻","sortOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_75","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"途亦幽尋，窈窕穿穀底。","sortOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_76","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"尘土填胸臆，到此方一洗。","sortOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_77","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"视劍戟鋒，巑岏顙有泚。","sortOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_78","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"俯窥蛟龍窟，匍伏首如稽。","sortOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_79","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"境固靈秘，茲遊實天啟。","sortOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_80","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"梵宇遍巖壑，簷牙相角抵。","sortOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_81","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"僧出延客，經營設酒醴。","sortOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_82","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"道引入雲霧，峻陟歷堂陛。","sortOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_83","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"田唯种椒，晚炊仍有米。","sortOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_84","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"張燈坐小軒，矮榻便倦體。","sortOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_85","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"遊感畴昔，陳李兩崑弟。","sortOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_86","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"侵晨訪舊跡，古碣埋荒荠。","sortOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_87","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"试諸生有作","sortOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_88","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"後相看眼倍明，絕怜詩骨逼人清。","sortOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_89","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"菁莪見辱真慚我，膠漆常存底用盟。","sortOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_90","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"海浮雲悲絕域，碧山秋月動新情。","sortOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_91","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"忧時謾作中宵坐，共聽萧萧落木聲。","sortOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_92","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"再试諸生","sortOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_93","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"堂深酌坐寒更，蠟炬煙消落降英。","sortOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_94","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"旅况最怜文作會，客心聊喜困還亨。","sortOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_95","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"回馬帳慚桃李，花滿田家憶紫荆。","sortOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_96","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"世事浮雲堪一笑，百年持此竟何成？","sortOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_97","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"夏日登易氏萬卷樓用唐韻","sortOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_98","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"樓六月自生寒，沓嶂回峰擁碧蘭。","sortOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_99","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"久客已忘非故土，此身兼喜是閒官。","sortOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_100","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"花傍晚煙初暝，深树新晴雨未幹。","sortOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_101","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"極目海天家萬里，風尘關塞欲歸難。","sortOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_102","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"再试諸生用唐韻","sortOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_103","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"涯猶未隔年回，何處嚴光有釣台？","sortOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_104","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"樽酒可怜人獨遠，封明舊詩石，","sortOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_105","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"來應自長莓苔。","sortOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_106","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"次韻陆文順佥憲","sortOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_107","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"王正月十七日，薄暮甚雨雷電風。","sortOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_108","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"卷我茅堂豈足念，傷茲歲事難為功。","sortOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_109","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"滕秋日亦已異，魯史冬月將無同。","sortOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_110","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"老臣正忧元氣泄，中夜起坐心忡忡。","sortOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_111","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"太子桥","sortOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_112","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"寒乍暖早春天，隨意尋芳到水邊。","sortOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_113","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"树里茅亭藏小景，竹間石溜引清泉。","sortOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_114","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"花照日猶含雨，岸柳垂陰漸滿川。","sortOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_115","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"欲把桥名尋野老，凄涼空說建文年。","sortOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_116","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"與胡少參小集","sortOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_117","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"雨初晴蠛蜢飛，小亭花竹晚涼微。","sortOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_118","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"後期客到停杯久，遠道春來得信稀。","sortOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_119","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"墨多凭消旅况，道心無賴入禪機。","sortOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_120","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"何時喜遂風泉賞，甘作山中一白衣？","sortOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_121","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"再用前韻賦鸚鵡","sortOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_122","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"垂猶憶隴西飛，金鎖長羁念力微。","sortOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_123","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"只為能言離土遠，可怜折翼叹群稀。","sortOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_124","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"林羞比黃鸝巧，晴渚思忘白鳥機。","sortOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_125","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"千古正平名正賦，風尘誰與惜毛衣？","sortOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_126","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"送客過二桥","sortOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_127","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"馬溪邊偶共行，好山當面正如屏。","sortOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_128","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"不緣送客何因到，還喜門人伴獨醒。","sortOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_129","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"洞巧容危膝坐，清泉不厭洗心聽。","sortOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_130","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"經過轉眼俱陳跡，多少高崖漫勒銘。","sortOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_131","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"复用杜韻一首","sortOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_132","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"纓何處有清流，三月尋幽始得幽。","sortOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_133","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"送客正逢催驿騎，笑人且复任沙鷗。","sortOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_134","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"傍石偃門双啟，洞口萝垂箔半鉤。","sortOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_135","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"淡我平生無一好，獨於泉石尚多求。","sortOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_136","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"先日與諸友有郊園之約是日因送客後期小詩寫懷","sortOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_137","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"園隔宿有幽期，送客三桥故故遲。","sortOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_138","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"樽酒定應須我久，諸君且莫向人疑。","sortOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_139","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"遊更憶春前日，歸醉先拚日暮時。","sortOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_140","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"却笑相望才咫尺，無因走馬送新詩。","sortOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_141","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"欲探幽肯後期，若為尘事故能遲。","sortOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_142","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"缓歸已受山童促，久坐翻令溪鳥疑。","sortOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_143","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"里清醅應幾酌，水邊相候定多時。","sortOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_144","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"臨風無限停雲思，回首空歌伐木詩。","sortOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_145","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"桥客散赴前期，縱辔還嫌馬足遲。","sortOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_146","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"好鳥花間先報語，浮雲山顶尚堪疑。","sortOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_147","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"傳江閣邀賓句，頗似篱邊送酒時。","sortOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_148","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"便與諸公須痛飲，日斜潦倒更題詩。","sortOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_149","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"待諸友不至","sortOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_150","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"間望眼欲崇朝，何事諸君跡尚遙？","sortOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_151","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"自處豈宜同俗駕，相期不獨醉春瓢。","sortOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_152","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"形爾我雖多缺，義重師生可待招。","sortOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_153","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"自是清遊須秉燭，莫將風雨負良宵。","sortOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_154","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"夏日遊陽明小洞天喜諸生偕集偶用唐韻","sortOrder":154},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_155","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"洞閒來日日遊，山中宰相勝封侯。","sortOrder":155},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_156","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"絕糧每自嗟尼父，慍見還時有仲由。","sortOrder":156},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_157","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"里高崖微入暑，石間寒溜已含秋。","sortOrder":157},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_158","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"他年故國懷諸友，魂夢還須到水頭。","sortOrder":158},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_159","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"將歸與諸生別於城南蔡氏樓","sortOrder":159},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_160","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"际層樓树杪开，夕陽下見鳥飛回。","sortOrder":160},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_161","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"城隅碧水光連座，槛外青山翠作堆。","sortOrder":161},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_162","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"恨眼前離別近，惟餘他日夢魂來。","sortOrder":162},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_163","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"新詩好記同遊處，長扫溪南舊釣台。","sortOrder":163},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_164","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"諸門人送至龍里道中二首","sortOrder":164},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_165","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"路高低入亂山，諸賢相送愧閒關。","sortOrder":165},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_166","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"溪雲壓帽兼愁重，峰雪吹衣著鬢斑。","sortOrder":166},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_167","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"燭夜堂還共語，桂枝秋殿聽跻攀。","sortOrder":167},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_168","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"跻攀之說甚陋，聊取其對偶耳。","sortOrder":168},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_169","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"思不用勤書札，別後吾言在订顽。","sortOrder":169},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_170","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"滿山城入暮天，歸心別意兩茫然。","sortOrder":170},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_171","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"及門真愧從陳日，微服還思過宋年。","sortOrder":171},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_172","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"酒無因同歲晚，緘書有雁寄春前。","sortOrder":172},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_173","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"莫辭秉燭通宵坐，明日相思隔隴煙。","sortOrder":173},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_174","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"赠陳宗魯","sortOrder":174},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_175","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"文須學古，脱俗去陳言。","sortOrder":175},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_176","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"譬若千丈木，勿為藤蔓纏。","sortOrder":176},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_177","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"如崑崙派，一泻成大川。","sortOrder":177},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_178","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"人言古今異，此語皆虛傳。","sortOrder":178},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_179","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"苟得其意，今古何異焉？","sortOrder":179},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_180","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"子才良可進，望汝師聖賢。","sortOrder":180},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_181","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"文乃餘事，聊雲子所偏。","sortOrder":181},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_182","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"醉後歌用燕思亭韻","sortOrder":182},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_183","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"峰攒簇高連天，貴陽久客經徂年。","sortOrder":183},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_184","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"思親謾想斑衣舞，寄籠恨已遲，","sortOrder":184},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_185","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"翮雲霄苦不早。","sortOrder":185},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_186","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"懷冥寂巖中人，萝衣菃佩芙蓉巾。","sortOrder":186},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_187","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"黃精紫芝滿山穀，石不愁仓菌貧。","sortOrder":187},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_188","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"溪常伴明月夜，小洞自報梅花春。","sortOrder":188},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_189","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"高間豈說商山皓，綽約真如藐姑神。","sortOrder":189},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_190","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"書遠寄貴陽客，胡不來歸浪相憶？","sortOrder":190},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_191","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"記取青松涧底枝，莫學楊花滿阡陌。","sortOrder":191},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_192","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"題施總兵所翁龍","sortOrder":192},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_193","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"不見所翁所畫龍，雖畫兩目不點瞳。","sortOrder":193},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_194","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"曾聞弟子誤落筆，即時雷雨飛騰空。","sortOrder":194},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_195","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"精入神奪元化，淺夫未識徒驚詫。","sortOrder":195},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_196","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"操舵移山律回陽，世間不獨所翁畫。","sortOrder":196},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_197","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"堂四壁生風雲，黑雷柴電日晝昏。","sortOrder":197},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_198","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"山崩穀陷屋瓦震，雨聲如泻長平軍。","sortOrder":198},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_199","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"角峥嵘歲千丈，倏忽神靈露幹象。","sortOrder":199},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_200","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"小臣正抱乌號思；一墮胡髯不可上。","sortOrder":200},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_201","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"久眩定凝心神，生绡漠漠开嶙峋。","sortOrder":201},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_202","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"乃知所翁遺筆跡，當年為寫蒼龍真。","sortOrder":202},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_203","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"今旱剧枯原野，萬國蒼生望霑麗。","sortOrder":203},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_204","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"凭誰拈筆點双睛，一作甘霖遍天下！","sortOrder":204},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_205","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"和大司馬白嚴乔公諸人送別","sortOrder":205},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_206","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"常白樓吳公、大司成莲北魯公、","sortOrder":206},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_207","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"少司成双溪汪公，相與集餞於清涼山，","sortOrder":207},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_208","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"又於借山亭，又再餞於大司馬第，","sortOrder":208},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_209","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"又出餞於龍江，諸公皆聊句為赠，","sortOrder":209},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_210","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"即席次奉酬，聊見留別之意。","sortOrder":210},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_211","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"去先愁別後思，百年何地更深知？","sortOrder":211},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_212","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"今宵燈火三人座，他日緘書一問之。","sortOrder":212},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_213","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"有煙霞刊肺腑，不堪霜雪妒須眉。","sortOrder":213},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_214","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"莫將分手看容易，知是重逢定幾時？","sortOrder":214},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_215","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"乡還日是多餘，長擬雲山信所知。","sortOrder":215},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_216","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"豈謂尚懸蒼水佩，無端又領紫泥書。","sortOrder":216},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_217","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"狼遠遁休為梗，鷗鷺初盟已漸虛。","sortOrder":217},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_218","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"他日姑蘇皈舊隱，總拈書籍便移居。","sortOrder":218},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_219","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"事俄驚蟋蟀先，向遊刚是早春天。","sortOrder":219},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_220","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"故人愈覺晨星少，別話聊凭杯酒筵。","sortOrder":220},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_221","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"馬驅馳非舊日，筆床相對又何年？","sortOrder":221},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_222","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"不因遠地疏蹤跡，惠我時裁金玉篇。","sortOrder":222},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_223","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"補涓埃愧聖朝，漫將投筆擬班超。","sortOrder":223},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_224","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"論交義重能相負？惜別情多屢見招。","sortOrder":224},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_225","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"入風尘兵甲滿，雲深湖海夢魂遙。","sortOrder":225},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_226","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"廟堂長策諸公在，銅柱何年打舊標？","sortOrder":226},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_227","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"航渺渺去鐘山，双闕回首杳霭間。","sortOrder":227},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_228","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"吳苑夕陽臨水別，江天風雨共秋還。","sortOrder":228},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_229","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"懷遠地書頻寄，後會何時鬢漸斑。","sortOrder":229},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_230","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"今夜夢魂汀渚隔，惟餘梁月照容顏。","sortOrder":230},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_231","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"遊白鹿洞歌","sortOrder":231},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_232","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"年白鹿洞，正傍五老峰。","sortOrder":232},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_233","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"五老去天不盈尺，俯窥人世煙雲重。","sortOrder":233},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_234","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"欲搅秀色，一一青芙蓉。","sortOrder":234},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_235","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"舉手石扇开半掩，绿鬟玉女如相逢。","sortOrder":235},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_236","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"雷隱隱萬壑泻，凭崖倚树聞清鐘。","sortOrder":236},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_237","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"洞門之外百丈松，千株化盡為蒼龍。","sortOrder":237},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_238","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"蒼龍，騎白鹿，泉甚飲，芝可服，","sortOrder":238},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_239","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"何人肯入空山宿？空山空山即我屋，","sortOrder":239},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_240","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"卷《黃庭》石上讀。","sortOrder":240},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_241","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"詠釣台石筍","sortOrder":241},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_242","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"根奇怪起双峰，慣歷風霜幾萬冬。","sortOrder":242},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_243","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"春去已無班箨落，雨餘唯見碧苔封。","sortOrder":243},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_244","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"隨眾卉生枝節，却笑繁花惹蝶蜂；","sortOrder":244},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_245","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"借使放梢成翠竹，等閒應得化虬龍。","sortOrder":245},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_246","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"遊雪窦","sortOrder":246},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_247","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"生性野多违俗，長望雲山叹式微；","sortOrder":247},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_248","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"暫向溪流濯尘冕，益怜薜萝勝朝衣。","sortOrder":248},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_249","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"間煙起知僧住，巖下雲开見鳥飛；","sortOrder":249},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_250","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"絕境自餘麋鹿伴，况聞體遠悟禪機。","sortOrder":250},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_251","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"山路斷獨來難，過盡千溪見石壇；","sortOrder":251},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_252","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"高閣鳴鐘僧睡起，深林無暑葛衣寒。","sortOrder":252},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_253","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"雷隱隱連巖瀑，山雨森森映竹竿；","sortOrder":253},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_254","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"莫訝諸峰俱眼熟，當年曾向書圖看。","sortOrder":254},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_255","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"居俯瞷萬山尖，六月涼飆早送炎。","sortOrder":255},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_256","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"夜枕風溪鳴急雨，晓窗宿霧卷青帘。","sortOrder":256},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_257","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"池种藕當峰顶，架竹分泉過屋簷。","sortOrder":257},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_258","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"幽穀時常思豹隱，深更猶自愧蛟潛。","sortOrder":258},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_259","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"晚堂吟","sortOrder":259},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_260","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"堂孤坐漫沉沉，數盡寒更落葉深。","sortOrder":260},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_261","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"高棟月明對燕語，古階霜細或馳吟。","sortOrder":261},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_262","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"評正恐非吾所，報答徒能盡此心。","sortOrder":262},{"id":"s_work_vtn_18_263","chapterId":"ch_work_vtn_18","text":"賴有勝遊堪自解，秋風華嶽得高尋。","sortOrder":263}],"overrides":{}}